@startuml Get Details Individual

participant "Calling Service" as Web
participant "Presenters API" as PresentersAPI
participant "Identity\n Verification API" as IDVAPI
box "Statement Matrix" #LightBlue
    participant "Presenter Type\n to Assoc Statement" as PTAS
    participant "Presenter Type\n to Delivery Statement" as PTDS
    participant "Presenter Type\n to Verification Statement" as PTVS
end box

Web -> PresentersAPI: Get details for verified individual
PresentersAPI -> IDVAPI: Get Personal Code, Name, DoB and Identity ID
PresentersAPI -> PTAS: Get Association Statement for Presenter Type
PresentersAPI -> PTDS: Get Delivery Statement for Presenter Type
PresentersAPI -> PTVS: Get Verification Statement for Presenter Type
PresentersAPI -> Web: Return details

@enduml

